---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Data Analytics - Adventa">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Data Analytics</h1>
      <p>Turn raw data into actionable insights with advanced analytics and visualization.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Comprehensive data analytics services to unlock the power of your data</p>
      
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Business Intelligence</h3>
          <p>We help you build comprehensive BI solutions that provide real-time visibility into your operations. From dashboards to automated reporting, we ensure the right information reaches the right people at the right time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Predictive Analytics</h3>
          <p>Look beyond historical data with our predictive modeling capabilities. We build models that forecast trends, identify risks, and uncover opportunities, enabling you to make proactive decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Data Visualization</h3>
          <p>Complex data becomes clear through effective visualization. We create intuitive, interactive dashboards and reports that make it easy to understand patterns, trends, and outliers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Machine Learning Models</h3>
          <p>We develop custom machine learning models tailored to your specific needs. Whether it's classification, regression, clustering, or recommendation systems, we build solutions that deliver results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Data Engineering</h3>
          <p>Quality analytics requires quality data. We help you build robust data pipelines, implement data governance, and ensure your data infrastructure is scalable and reliable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Statistical Analysis</h3>
          <p>Our statisticians apply rigorous analytical methods to answer your business questions. From hypothesis testing to experimental design, we ensure your conclusions are statistically sound.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Our Technology Stack</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">We work with industry-leading tools and platforms</p>
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          Our analytics solutions leverage the best tools for each job. We're experienced with Python, R, SQL, and a wide range of analytics platforms including Tableau, Power BI, and custom web-based solutions.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
          For data engineering, we work with modern data stacks including cloud data warehouses (Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift), ETL tools, and orchestration platforms. We ensure your data infrastructure is built for scale and maintainability.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>